# VideoBrief — YouTube

## Scope

YouTube URLs only. No uploads. No audio transcription.

## TranscriptProvider

- Default impl: `youtubei.js` (Innertube)
- Interface must allow swap to proxy or external fetch worker later (Vercel IPs may be blocked)
- MVP strategy: ship without residential proxy; document failure mode; keep interface ready

## English only

Prefer/require **English** caption tracks. If no accessible English timestamped transcript → user-facing error; do not fall back to Whisper or other languages.

Preserve segment timestamps for chapter sync.

## Metadata

Fetch title, channel, duration, thumbnail via the same provider boundary (or YouTube Data API later if needed). Cache on shared `videos` / `video_transcripts` by YouTube id.

## Player

Use **`react-youtube`** for the workspace (IFrame API):

- Poll or listen for current time → highlight active chapter
- Chapter click → `seekTo`
- Sync is client-only; no AI during playback

Do not use lite-embed for the workspace (insufficient control).
